<title>USA: Pride Petroleum files $500 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Pride Petroleum files $500 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pride Petroleum Services Inc filed a shelf registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to $500 million in debt securities and common stock.</p>
<p>The company said proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include refinancings of debt, working capital, capital expenditures, acquisitions and repurchases and redemptions of securities.</p>
</text>
